## Section: Bash Scripting

To pass this room:
---------------------------------------------------------------------

- A protected script only responds to the correct combination of flags.
- Study the locked_program.sh script and call it with the right flags.

## Tasks:

1. Read locked_program.sh to understand what flags it expects.
   >> hint: `cat locked_program.sh`

2. The script uses getopts to validate its arguments.
   It expects: -u <username> -p <pin> and optionally -v (verbose)

3. Call it with the correct values.
   >> hint: `bash locked_program.sh -u agent -p 1337 -v`

4. The output when all conditions pass is the password.

>> Decrypt tip for next room:
   openssl enc -aes-256-cbc -d -a -pbkdf2 -in ../room_34/README -out ../room_34/README.txt -pass pass:PASSWORD

Good Luck !!!
